{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0401","text":"У нас дома тепло и уютно.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0402","text":"Мне нравится убираться.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0403","text":"Окно выходит на парк.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0404","text":"Мне не спится.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0405","text":"Мебель стоит очень дорого.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0406","text":"Дверь не закрыта.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0407","text":"Полы помыты вчера.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0408","text":"Сколько комнат в этой квартире?","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0409","text":"Можно войти?","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0410","text":"Прибери за собой!","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0411","text":"Дома лучше всего.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0412","text":"Стены имеют уши.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0413","text":"Свет в конце тоннеля.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0414","text":"Наш дом капитальный.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"false_friend","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0415","text":"Дом на реставрации.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"false_friend","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0416","text":"Лампа перегорела, надо купить новую.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0417","text":"Диван удобный, но старый.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0418","text":"Крыша протекает.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0419","text":"Комната выглядит запущенной.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0420","text":"Стекло разбито.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0421","text":"Уберись в комнате до прихода гостей.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0422","text":"Кран течёт уже неделю.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0423","text":"Холодильник нужно разморозить.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0424","text":"Соседи шумят по ночам.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0425","text":"На кухне пахнет газом.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0426","text":"Мой дом — моя крепость.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0427","text":"Жилплощадь небольшая, но уютная.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0428","text":"Квартира сдаётся в аренду.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0429","text":"Надо заменить замок на двери.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0430","text":"Мы переехали в новый район.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0431","text":"Он живёт как у Христа за пазухой.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"idiom","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0432","text":"Прихожая слишком маленькая.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0433","text":"Батарея не греет.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0434","text":"В доме сделан капитальный ремонт.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0435","text":"Шторы нужно постирать.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0436","text":"Он купил дом в ипотеку.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0437","text":"Электричество отключили на час.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0438","text":"Она обставила квартиру по своему вкусу.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0439","text":"Ковёр требует химчистки.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0440","text":"Балкон застеклён.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0441","text":"Система отопления вышла из строя.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0442","text":"Лифт не работает третий день.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0443","text":"Дети играют во дворе.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0444","text":"Посуда перемыта.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0445","text":"Мусор надо вынести.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0446","text":"Подвал затопило.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0447","text":"Гараж закрыт на замок.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0448","text":"Стены покрашены в белый цвет.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"home","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0449","text":"Садовый шланг сломался.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
{"id":"SRC-RU-EN-GEN-0450","text":"Бельё сохнет на балконе.","language":"ru","domain":"general","topic":"household","license":"original","batch_index":4}
